# Build output destination.
#
# `npm run build` bundles to main.js in the repository root, then copies
# main.js, manifest.json, and styles.css into the directory below.
#
# This must point at the plugin folder itself (the directory Obsidian loads
# main.js from), NOT the vault root. Defaults to:
#   ~/Obsidians/Omarchy-Desktop/.obsidian/plugins/antigravity
#
# Example:
# OBSIDIAN_PLUGIN_PATH=/path/to/your/vault/.obsidian/plugins/antigravity
